ustomers`/`erpSuppliers`.\n\n**Fix applied:** `buildProductNodes()` now queries `erpItems` and attaches a new `GENERIC_PRODUCT_ACTIONS` leaf set (\"Update price/stock\", \"Create a quotation\"), mirroring the existing Customer/Vendor pattern. Removed the now-dead `genericProjectActions()` helper and cleaned up stale comments.\n\n**Verified:** `tsc --noEmit` clean, full test suite 2216/2216 passing (9 new regression tests), lint clean, and confirmed `demo_project_website` isn't hardcoded anywhere in source.\n\n**PR opened (not merged):** https://github.com/FChecklist/compliance-tracker/pull/607 — awaiting the required fresh supervisor audit per task governance.","ttft_ms":1457,"ttft_stream_ms":1055,"time_to_request_ms":33,"type":"result","duration_ms":663089,"uuid":"dc5e1a55-e2f4-4253-b284-96b47b05043b"}
